{"id":"n31477-1-7","stage":4,"title":"결실 · 结果","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31477-1-7-1","ko":"논에 벼가 아주 잘 익었네.","zh":"田里的稻子已经熟得很好了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"논에","meaning":"水田，稻田","explanation":"논：水田，稻田；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"논","audio":"/audio/720bce5ed1c8c73c1bee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23897","senseId":"1","lemma":"논","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"논에","audio":"/audio/6b20554fdb6f9b4ee485.mp3"}},{"text":"벼가","meaning":"水稻","explanation":"벼：水稻；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"벼","audio":"/audio/e700a159a08353b47927.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14469","senseId":"1","lemma":"벼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벼가","audio":"/audio/b113d9563c6ae3c78673.mp3"}},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很。","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，了不起地","explanation":"잘：很好地，了不起地。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"8","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"익었네.","meaning":"成熟，浓郁","explanation":"익다：成熟，浓郁；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"익다","audio":"/audio/615092c47f4ab18c0d1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63510","senseId":"5","lemma":"익다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"익었네","audio":"/audio/e2b3e6fcb2e1d1f4085c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"720bce5ed1c8c73c","term":"논","zh":"水田，稻田","audio":"/audio/720bce5ed1c8c73c1bee.mp3","entryId":"23897","definition":"为耕种水稻而特意蓄水的耕地。","pronunciation":["논"]},{"id":"e700a159a08353b4","term":"벼","zh":"水稻","audio":"/audio/e700a159a08353b47927.mp3","entryId":"14469","definition":"以大米为果实的农作物；或指其果实。","pronunciation":["벼"]},{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，了不起地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"非常好地、优秀地，值得称赞地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"615092c47f4ab18c","term":"익다","zh":"成熟，浓郁","audio":"/audio/615092c47f4ab18c0d1f.mp3","entryId":"63510","definition":"事物、时机、气氛等准备充分或正值佳期。","pronunciation":["익따"]}],"audio":"/audio/eacdffbd327dcb922c66.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31477-1-7-2","ko":"벌써 결실의 계절인 가을이 왔구나.","zh":"秋天这个收获的季节已经到来了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经。","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}},{"text":"결실의","meaning":"结果，果实","explanation":"결실：结果，果实；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"결실","audio":"/audio/699fdf5c62ba8c726314.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31477","senseId":"1","lemma":"결실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"결실의","audio":"/audio/29ce9f0ac7ad95242785.mp3"}},{"text":"계절인","meaning":"季节，季","explanation":"계절：季节，季；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"계절","audio":"/audio/de3d981ff9b0dab8c5c4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22537","senseId":"1","lemma":"계절","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계절인","audio":"/audio/c3726ffd7a2a8ad9067f.mp3"}},{"text":"가을이","meaning":"秋天，秋季","explanation":"가을：秋天，秋季；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가을","audio":"/audio/c5911194be78d7d5c393.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32204","senseId":"1","lemma":"가을","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가을이","audio":"/audio/9c786870b862ca6b7399.mp3"}},{"text":"왔구나.","meaning":"到","explanation":"오다：到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"19","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔구나","audio":"/audio/ddc1c6eba81bbc9d0f6c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"699fdf5c62ba8c72","term":"결실","zh":"结果，果实","audio":"/audio/699fdf5c62ba8c726314.mp3","entryId":"31477","definition":"谷物或果树上长出果子或长出的果子成熟；或指该果子。","pronunciation":["결씰"]},{"id":"de3d981ff9b0dab8","term":"계절","zh":"季节，季","audio":"/audio/de3d981ff9b0dab8c5c4.mp3","entryId":"22537","definition":"根据自然现象将一年分为春、夏、秋、冬时的其中一部分。","pronunciation":["계ː절","게ː절"]},{"id":"c5911194be78d7d5","term":"가을","zh":"秋天，秋季","audio":"/audio/c5911194be78d7d5c393.mp3","entryId":"32204","definition":"四季中的一个，介于夏天和冬天之间的季节。","pronunciation":["가을"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"某个时间或季节等来临。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5437e89c91c2a5757a5d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.83,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=31477","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":136,"sequenceScore":2.6567,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["秋天这个收获的季节已经到来了啊。","田里的稻子已经熟得很好了呢。","我决定要去留学了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["田里的稻子已经熟得很好了呢。","我决定要去留学了。","秋天这个收获的季节已经到来了啊。"],"answer":2}]}
